# The server side of the held-event run. Each boost marks its id and whether it is a redelivery.

on test boost (held):
	set {_n} to boost number
	if event is redelivered:
		mark "boost %{_n}% %event id% redelivered"
	else:
		mark "boost %{_n}% %event id% first"
	if {_n} is "5":
		if event is not redelivered:
			withhold the event ack
	if {_n} is "6":
		wait for gate "g"
		mark "boost 6 finished"
